; ===== photo =====
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:06.61,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We're HKT48's 7th-generation kenkyuusei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:15.22,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,HKT48 7th-gen kenkyuusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:16.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ramune no nomikata performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:18.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's Eura Yuka's birthday show!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:23.94,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,First of all…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.76,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kizashi, Schoolyard Puppy, Disco Infirmary,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:26.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and Omatase Setlist—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.84,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,you've just heard four songs in a row, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Is everyone getting hyped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:36.46,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Did you wave Yuka-chan's penlights a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:39.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:42.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well then, right away, we'd like to take a commemorative photo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:44.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:48.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:50.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.86,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ishii-chan, want to go stand next to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:56.12,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You want her to come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:56.89,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:04.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:07.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So, birthday girl—what pose are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:10.75,Generic,Eura Yuka,0,0,0,,Well, I just did Puppy for the first time in a while, so dog pose, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:11.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:18.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:20.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What about everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:20.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:22.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Let's all become Yuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:23.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Let's be Yuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:26.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Let us do Yuka, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:27.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:35.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And for the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:36.72,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And for the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:37.92,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay, let's all do hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.99,0:20:38.64,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:03.76,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The photos we just took will be sold in the lobby after the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:05.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,so please stop by for a memory of today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for your support!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.18,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for your support!

; ===== intro =====
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:19.58,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,One by one, please introduce yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:29.33,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today's topic is: something you absolutely can't let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:33.74,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay, starting with Rara-pa, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:40.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Please focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:41.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Alright then—Riria-turn, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:52.98,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,My turn, your turn, everyone's turn is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:54.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:59.86,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,From Nagasaki Prefecture, second-year junior high, 14—Riria-turn, Ijima Riria. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:01.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Riria-turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:02.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:08.86,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,Um, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:11.11,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:13.01,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,Contact lenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:13.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:19.02,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,Sometimes I don't wear them day to day, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.00,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,I want to see all your faces, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:24.23,Generic,Rii-ritan,0,0,0,,I'm wearing them properly today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:27.50,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:36.48,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Loves melon! / Loves Yuuka! / Bright smile—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.55,0:22:37.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:38.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:43.14,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,From Yamaguchi Prefecture, first-year high school, 16—Mei-mei, Yoshida Mei. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.21,0:22:44.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Mei-mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:48.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:52.33,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of—well…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.75,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,or rather, someone precious to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:57.90,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,It's all of you fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:00.62,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:03.79,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:05.51,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Well, I do look at everyone's…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.58,0:23:07.86,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,comments a lot…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.93,0:23:09.61,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,Even when I'm a bit down…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:12.51,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,looking at everyone's supportive comments…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.58,0:23:14.09,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,really cheers me up, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:15.97,Generic,Mei-mei,0,0,0,,I really feel how precious you all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:18.98,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll celebrate Yuuka with all I've got today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.05,0:23:20.57,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:22.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:27.43,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Sparkling eyes and round cheeks—that'd be…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:28.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Aya-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:30.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.77,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,In my right cheek is Yuuka, in my left is Yuuka-chan—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:37.19,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Today I'll deliver power to everyone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:38.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Fuu—!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.13,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:41.01,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,From Nagasaki Prefecture, 14—Ryuto Ayane. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:42.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:50.40,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,What I can't let go of is a person…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:56.06,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I have a little sister in third grade of elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:23:58.60,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,and she's really tsundere with me—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.76,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,she barely calls me big sis or says anything kind—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:02.76,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,she never says those things to me, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.83,0:24:05.42,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I know she actually loves me a ton,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:09.28,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,and I'll work hard as an idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:11.80,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,so someday the two of us can travel abroad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.48,0:24:15.50,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,That's what I'm aiming for!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.26,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll celebrate Yuuka with all I've got today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:26.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll celebrate Yuuka with all I've got today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:27.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:35.45,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,What you love—marshmallows? Macarons?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.81,0:24:37.03,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Mari-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.04,0:24:42.38,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,Thank you! Yuuka-obsessed Mari-tan, Yamakawa Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.60,0:24:43.96,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Mari-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.42,0:24:47.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:49.30,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,What I can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.37,0:24:50.98,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,a keychain Mom bought me—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.02,0:24:53.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,a keychain—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:57.26,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,it's shaped like a teru-teru bozu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:25:00.26,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,I'm a huge rain-woman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:01.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.60,0:25:02.56,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,I really am. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.84,0:25:05.72,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,Mom couldn't just watch, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:10.30,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,she said, 'Carry this with you,' and bought it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.48,0:25:15.90,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,and when I have it, it feels like it won't rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.80,0:25:18.20,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,that's why I carry it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.46,0:25:20.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:25.91,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,Born from a strawberry field—
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:28.01,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Moka-pi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:30.09,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,Cute like a strawberry blossom today too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.29,0:25:31.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So cuuute!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:32.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:36.71,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,Fresh as a strawberry, 16—Matsumoto Moka. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.25,0:25:38.19,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Moka-pi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:41.65,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:44.28,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.35,0:25:45.66,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,also a person…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:47.42,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.54,0:25:50.80,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,I've got childhood friends my age—
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:55.49,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,when I'm in trouble or worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.56,0:25:57.64,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,if I LINE them they reply instantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:26:00.67,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,and if I say I want to see them, they'll meet me that same day—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.74,0:26:04.48,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,they're truly kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:06.72,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,I'll do my best today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.85,0:26:08.50,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.33,0:26:17.15,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,North, south, east, west—favorite direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.55,0:26:18.20,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,South!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.69,0:26:20.18,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Apartment hunting—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.94,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,South-facing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:23.13,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Cute-girl hunting—?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:24.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Southwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.52,0:26:26.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:29.94,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Hakata's Southern Cross—Mii-na, Nakano Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:32.30,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:38.75,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:41.82,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.22,0:26:43.86,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,my smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:48.52,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I just really love my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:50.61,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Literally around the clock—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.19,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,whenever there's a chance I'm on my phone—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:53.68,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,that's the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.48,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,So I stay up late on my phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.18,0:27:02.85,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,and Mom scolds me every night—that's the routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.92,0:27:05.28,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I'm always about to get it confiscated,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.74,0:27:08.16,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,So, um, at least for today—from my phone—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:10.44,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Smartphone…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:12.76,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,So at least today, from my phone…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.18,0:27:13.83,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,a bit…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:16.82,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I want to graduate from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.02,0:27:19.77,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll celebrate Yuuka with all I've got today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.84,0:27:20.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:29.46,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 14—a bit clumsy but full of smiles…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.02,0:27:30.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.08,0:27:32.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.98,0:27:35.32,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,Nacchi, Tsurukawa Nachi. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.91,0:27:40.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.03,0:27:45.87,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,What Nacchi absolutely can't let go of…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.51,0:27:47.69,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,It's headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.25,0:27:53.36,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,Lately Amiyun and Mei-mei and lots of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.43,0:27:57.89,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,matching ones in different colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.81,0:28:00.56,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,I wear them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.63,0:28:01.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,You wear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.81,0:28:05.57,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,I wear them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.37,0:28:11.25,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,listening to music I like while walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:12.95,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,I've got them on constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.49,0:28:16.73,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,when I meet friends I take them off, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.25,0:28:20.23,Generic,Nacchi,0,0,0,,Nacchi absolutely cannot let go of headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.89,0:28:21.54,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.16,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:23.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.05,0:28:31.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic, please answer 'to that destination' with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.29,0:28:34.71,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,If Sara wishes it…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.49,0:28:36.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,To that destination!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.58,0:28:38.87,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,I'm small, but make sure you find me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.94,0:28:45.44,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,Find me! From Aichi Prefecture, first-year high school, 16—Sara-tan, Katahira Sara. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.73,0:28:57.62,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of is games.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:29:04.19,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying touching stuff about friends, and me? A game console…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.31,0:29:10.07,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,There's a game I've played since about first grade of elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:17.56,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,I haven't played it much lately, but there's a game I'm really into.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:23.76,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,That game is like a stabilizer for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.83,0:29:26.39,Generic,Sara,0,0,0,,so without it I couldn't live!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.61,0:29:30.38,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:38.42,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Let's go! This tone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.49,0:29:43.54,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,coloring your heart—Ayane iro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:44.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.81,0:29:47.39,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture—Yuuka's favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.46,0:29:49.04,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.83,0:29:52.36,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Aa-tan, Ishii Ayane. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.43,0:29:53.08,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.18,0:30:01.89,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:07.15,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying friends or fans, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.22,0:30:09.72,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But for me it's the turtle we keep at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.62,0:30:13.82,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?! It might turn into a touching story!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.66,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Okay I raised the bar too high, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:20.29,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,My reason is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.36,0:30:24.36,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,we've had the turtle since before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.64,0:30:31.18,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,It somehow became like a housemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.60,0:30:36.40,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,When I left home for the 7th-gen audition,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.04,0:30:42.60,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I prayed to the turtle every day—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:46.23,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,'Please let me pass,' I asked the turtle in the tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:50.28,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and I was away from home about a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:52.82,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,So I got a turtle's repayment of kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:57.91,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I'll keep connected with my turtle and live leisurely on turtle-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:00.45,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,riding atop my turtle, taking it easy…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.94,0:31:06.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll celebrate Yuuka with all I've got today!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.46,0:31:07.98,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.08,0:31:08.87,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:14.29,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,What's your mood percent today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.03,0:31:16.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.91,0:31:18.98,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,How many percent is your love for Nagano?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.38,0:31:20.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.60,0:31:23.40,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Is this dance 100 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:24.22,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.29,0:31:25.00,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,200 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.20,0:31:25.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.92,0:31:26.60,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Rara percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:33.63,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,From Nagasaki Prefecture, 14—Rara-pa, Nagano Rara. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:34.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Rara-pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.66,0:31:41.11,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,What I absolutely can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.18,0:31:43.46,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.12,0:31:47.05,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Even when I'm dancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.12,0:31:50.89,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,I like being aware of my hair all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.96,0:31:52.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.68,0:31:55.73,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Eh—all of a sudden…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:56.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.52,0:32:01.60,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Lately I'm hooked on making my hair pretty,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.47,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,so I can't let go of my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:08.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Today I'll hype up Yuuka—
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.08,0:32:12.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I'll hype up Yuuka's birthday show!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.60,0:32:14.43,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:16.11,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.18,0:32:16.83,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.65,0:32:20.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Always, to Yuuka—
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.66,0:32:21.30,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.37,0:32:22.82,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,This is Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:23.97,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I am—
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.04,0:32:24.84,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.72,0:32:26.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.44,0:32:29.31,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,With a smile-ball, I want to score a goal in everyone's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:35.28,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, second-year junior high, 14—Yuuka, Eura Yuka. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:36.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.79,0:32:37.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.37,0:32:42.02,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.67,0:32:43.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.47,0:32:44.45,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.09,0:32:45.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:47.87,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.27,0:32:51.74,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Wait, what was it again? Can't let go of…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.81,0:32:56.80,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I agonized so hard—I was stuck between two things!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.87,0:32:57.98,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Which do you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.05,0:32:58.70,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Which do you want to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.43,0:33:00.42,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:01.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.55,0:33:02.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The good one…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.44,0:33:05.89,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,What I can't let go of is…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.41,0:33:07.68,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Yes—Ishii!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.75,0:33:08.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ishii!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.47,0:33:13.03,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Yes—Ishii!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.45,0:33:14.32,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,That Ishii…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.39,0:33:19.84,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Ishii looks after me in all sorts of ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.38,0:33:26.88,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and today she even bought me macarons I love as a treat,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:32.09,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,so yeah—what you need to have is an Ishii!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.16,0:33:34.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.54,0:33:35.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.44,0:33:36.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.63,0:33:46.73,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 13—100-yen-shop lover Yuu-chan, Kure Yuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.17,0:33:48.37,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,Kure Yuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.52,0:33:52.84,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,I'll give you love — looking for oshi! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:33:58.51,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.48,0:34:03.30,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,throat lozenges!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:05.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,As expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.24,0:34:10.02,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,I always keep them in my bag—when my throat's dry…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.40,0:34:13.85,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,or when I want to refresh, I love eating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:14.96,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.94,0:34:16.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:17.34,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.10,0:34:19.22,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,Highly recommend!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.04,0:34:22.08,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.74,0:34:28.36,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,Yui's favorite bread is…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.88,0:34:30.70,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Mentaiko French bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.77,0:34:32.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The bread that loves Yui is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.06,0:34:34.84,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yui-pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.91,0:34:35.56,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.99,0:34:39.26,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 15—Matsunaga Yui. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.33,0:34:40.57,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yui-pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.83,0:34:45.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.17,0:34:51.14,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,a slightly nice lip product I bought recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.21,0:34:52.95,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,a slightly nice lip product I bought recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.33,0:34:59.83,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,and somehow it's the exact same color and kind as Ryuto Ayane-chan's!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.35,0:35:04.64,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,If you watched yesterday's stream you'd know—
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.71,0:35:07.57,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,we already did couple-ish matching,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.69,0:35:09.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nice~
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.41,0:35:11.15,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,and it made me feel kinda nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.19,0:35:14.69,Generic,Yui,0,0,0,,If you're curious, check YouTube!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.15,0:35:16.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.03,0:35:18.31,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.64,0:35:24.84,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When I point the mic, please do magokoro, se-no, and Amiyun with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.94,0:35:30.30,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Shiritori, heeere we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.06,0:35:34.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Little devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.12,0:35:35.92,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Magokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.74,0:35:37.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:38.88,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Se-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.48,0:35:41.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:42.96,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Fukuoka's lucky girl is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:44.46,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:45.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.86,0:35:49.94,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, 13—Amiyun, Ishikawa Amiyu. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.46,0:35:51.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Amiyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.05,0:35:58.10,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I've got three things I can't let go of—
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:36:01.66,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I'll explain two of them together—they're not things, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.73,0:36:06.91,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Reia-san and Reia-san's smile are truly my reason for living!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.98,0:36:10.17,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,and today I wanted to copy Reia-san's mole—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.24,0:36:13.37,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,For those who saw Reia-san's post, you'll understand, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.44,0:36:18.44,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,today she drew the mole on me directly—right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.20,0:36:28.40,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Those are two of them, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:32.12,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I recently got TMJ disorder,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.62,0:36:36.90,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,so every time I open my mouth it goes clack-clack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:42.15,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Even when I went to the movies with Ikuno-san, it echoed through the theater so loud—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.22,0:36:44.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Too severe!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.92,0:36:48.68,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,the third is I want to take care of my jaw—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.05,0:36:51.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please take care of me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.90,0:37:02.56,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,HKT48 7th-gen kenkyuusei — Ramune no nomikata performance — these are our members!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.74,0:37:08.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next up, various units take the stage. Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.42,0:37:09.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Please enjoy!

; ===== mc1 =====
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.31,0:57:59.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Cross, Finland Miracle, Manazashi Sayonara, Lying Ostrich, and Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.79,0:58:04.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You've been listening to those back-to-back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.97,0:58:11.27,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We'll be hosting this MC, the two of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.57,0:58:14.09,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Heart's pounding, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.83,0:58:19.25,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So surprising!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.13,0:58:25.18,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So today, for the first-timers…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.25,0:58:27.25,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,we'd like to ask Amiyun-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.82,0:58:31.94,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.16,0:58:36.07,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I've only ever done Ostrich until now, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.14,0:58:38.47,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,it was a bit tough, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.54,0:58:41.75,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Ostrich's a three-person unit, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.82,0:58:45.89,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,but Nice to meet you! is five people!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:50.92,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Five-person units are rare, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.99,0:58:52.77,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I was really nervous, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.19,0:58:57.87,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Right up until showtime, Moka-pi and others kept saying, "Hang in there—you can do it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.35,0:59:00.09,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,and I felt so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.73,0:59:06.44,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She practiced so hard right up to the last minute—
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.51,0:59:08.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I really want to learn from that!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.15,0:59:09.83,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.51,0:59:15.67,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,No, I'm really nervous—this MC too!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.05,0:59:18.78,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Two-person MCs are pretty rare, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.85,0:59:22.03,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I almost want everyone to stand up one by one for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.57,0:59:26.13,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's really surprising, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.75,0:59:31.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And yesterday was our one-year anniversary, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.27,0:59:34.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.83,0:59:39.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So looking back on the year—how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.93,0:59:44.56,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,For me personally, the biggest thing is…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.63,0:59:46.73,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,I think I really cleaned up my look!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.73,0:59:51.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,The growth I feel most is that glow-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.21,0:59:54.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You're seriously so pretty now!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.47,0:59:56.73,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Kure-chan too!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.80,0:59:58.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.38,0:59:59.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,No, really!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.07,1:00:03.10,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Like, a year ago she was a bit…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.42,1:00:03.88,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,Ehh—
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:05.79,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,She's been cute from the start—very, very cute—
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.86,1:00:07.11,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,but she's grown a bit more now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.18,1:00:11.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Even her wording and personality feel a bit more adult!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.34,1:00:13.57,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Adult already!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.30,1:00:16.37,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Kure-san's the more adult one…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.44,1:00:17.67,Generic,Yuna,0,0,0,,No, Ishikawa-san is!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.70,1:00:20.50,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Amiyun-chan, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.62,1:00:24.55,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Where I've grown, huh…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.62,1:00:29.32,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,my nerves have gone down, just a little!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.62,1:00:30.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thanks to who?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.38,1:00:36.76,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,To all the 7th-gen members, the staff,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.28,1:00:39.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mom's gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.44,1:00:42.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Mom's gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.59,1:00:49.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But in 7th gen there are all kinds of roles,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.07,1:00:54.77,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and lots of people who get treated like moms even in private!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.23,1:00:57.55,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Let's keep going hard toward year two!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.24,1:01:04.24,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So then—let's hype up the second half too!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.03,1:01:11.94,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,HKT48 7th-gen kenkyuusei — Ramune no nomikata performance!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.01,1:01:14.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Is everyone burning hot?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.47,1:01:20.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Can you celebrate Yuka-chan lots?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.29,1:01:25.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next up is this song—please enjoy!

; ===== mc2 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.14,1:13:15.57,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kodoku na Ballerina, and Ima Kimi to Irareru Koto,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.64,1:13:20.04,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and Winning Ball—you've heard three songs in a row, are you all fired up?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.34,1:13:23.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.64,1:13:26.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Today is Yuuka's birthday show, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.28,1:13:30.80,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,we'd like to hear what you love about Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:33.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Starting with someone who did a unit with her today—Rara-pa
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.79,1:13:36.37,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,What I like about Yuuka is—
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.44,1:13:37.40,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Well, somehow…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.92,1:13:40.76,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,that youngest-child vibe—she is the youngest, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.84,1:13:42.78,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,she's like a baby,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.80,1:13:45.18,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,she comes to you all clingy, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.06,1:13:47.32,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She clings to Rara-pa too?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.44,1:13:48.09,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.16,1:13:49.90,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Surprisingly clingy too…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.52,1:13:57.55,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,She talks so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.62,1:13:58.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.02,1:14:01.90,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,So we chat a ton.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.42,1:14:03.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,With Eura, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.30,1:14:06.60,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Sorry—my brain hadn't caught up yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.52,1:14:09.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I'm like one beat behind, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.38,1:14:11.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Right—Yuuka does have that baby vibe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.95,1:14:12.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.66,1:14:15.16,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I think everyone watching thinks so too, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.66,1:14:17.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She does seem baby-like, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.26,1:14:22.99,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When you watch the two of them talk,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.06,1:14:25.56,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She's got her own quirky side, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.26,1:14:29.68,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Her jokes are kind of…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.12,1:14:30.73,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.80,1:14:32.10,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,like black jokes,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.98,1:14:37.09,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,people often say that about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.16,1:14:39.12,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Kure-chan, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.38,1:14:43.69,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,I love how devoted Yuuka-chan is!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.76,1:14:45.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What part feels devoted to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.72,1:14:50.54,Generic,Yuu-chan,0,0,0,,She's always saying she loves Ishii-chan, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.30,1:14:52.08,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's dependency!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.41,1:14:57.65,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,Yesterday, a bunch of the 7th gen went out to eat together,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.05,1:15:00.25,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,and then when we were walking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.39,1:15:02.79,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,she kept grabbing around here on Ishii while we walked,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.86,1:15:05.82,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,just clinging the whole time, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.56,1:15:08.74,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,I tried peeling them apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.56,1:15:11.02,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.16,1:15:13.92,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nooo! No no no no!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.14,1:15:16.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well, like…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.42,1:15:19.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well, Rara loves Ishii too,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.06,1:15:24.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Rara likes Ishii and Yuuka likes her too,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.70,1:15:28.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,they were stuck like that the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.90,1:15:31.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll recreate it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.62,1:15:32.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.82,1:15:37.51,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Amiyun, Eura—like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.58,1:15:40.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and we're walking like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.77,1:15:47.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's a little devil!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.43,1:15:52.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,A little devil, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.07,1:15:59.59,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,What we love about Eura-chan…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.33,1:16:00.98,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.53,1:16:06.24,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We just said the little-devil bit, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.31,1:16:08.43,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,Well, for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.87,1:16:10.91,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,There are so many things I love about Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.31,1:16:15.65,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,In Finland Miracle I'm always with Yuuka, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.29,1:16:20.64,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,When we hold hands, she always looks toward me and Mei-mei,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.71,1:16:24.28,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,She checks on each of us once!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.35,1:16:29.20,Generic,Mari-tan,0,0,0,,it's hit me since rehearsal!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.27,1:16:34.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka really is puppy-like!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.45,1:16:39.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,During the show I make eye contact a lot too, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.49,1:16:43.45,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,she always does this little wink!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.75,1:16:49.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,When eyes meet she grins and winks!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.77,1:16:52.85,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I only picture Rara doing that…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.51,1:16:57.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Rara does it constantly,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.65,1:16:59.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She gets ignored?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.61,1:17:01.71,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Isn't that tsundere?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.57,1:17:03.22,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.11,1:17:05.76,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nagano…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.25,1:17:09.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait—she does?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.43,1:17:13.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Speaking of her looking at you—
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.21,1:17:15.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,in Disco Infirmary, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.91,1:17:17.52,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,there's a button right here,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.59,1:17:20.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and it had come undone,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.91,1:17:23.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and up on the platform there's this little move,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.41,1:17:27.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I tried to snap it shut quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.79,1:17:29.63,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,while I was trying to shut it my hands were shaking,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.09,1:17:31.25,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and it wouldn't close!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.25,1:17:33.91,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Then Eura pretended to look—
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.81,1:17:36.75,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and closed the button—then Eura—
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.59,1:17:38.17,Generic,Amiyun,0,0,0,,Ahaha!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.31,1:17:39.49,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I was so shocked—
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.97,1:17:43.89,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,she peeked in at me—would she go this far?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.43,1:17:48.11,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,This kid stakes her life on eye contact!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.17,1:17:53.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Making eye contact is…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.33,1:17:56.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,it's startling when it's sudden!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.01,1:17:57.05,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,That startled me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.05,1:17:59.47,Generic,Moka-pi,0,0,0,,Fans, do you make a lot of eye contact with Yuuka?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.55,1:18:01.39,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.39,1:18:03.43,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,If it'd been 'we don't,' though…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.43,1:18:05.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.95,1:18:08.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka's actually pretty put-together,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.76,1:18:09.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.48,1:18:11.28,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Is she put-together?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.52,1:18:12.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The straight man?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.24,1:18:17.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Sometimes, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.28,1:18:22.05,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,I'd fall asleep,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.12,1:18:22.78,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Properly!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.48,1:18:28.08,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka really doesn't sleep at all, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.84,1:18:33.46,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,I was the only one watching a movie while she slept next to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.90,1:18:36.97,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She fell asleep in like four minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.04,1:18:41.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Well, sleep lots—I hope you grow a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.70,1:18:43.98,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Next up is the second half—please enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.04,1:18:44.39,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.59,1:18:55.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,For the second half, we'll continue with this cast including Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.35,1:19:04.22,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So for the second half too, more about what we love about Yuuka—
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.29,1:19:08.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and the first person Yuuka already nominated to talk…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.41,1:19:10.45,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That kind of pick?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.75,1:19:12.00,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Who do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.07,1:19:13.41,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Maybe me…?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.67,1:19:15.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hmm, I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.81,1:19:19.45,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ishii Ayane-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.29,1:19:23.65,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,What I love about Yuuka—well, one thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.25,1:19:24.90,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I've got one!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.97,1:19:27.04,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Only one!?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.11,1:19:30.40,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,If I may say one thing—
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.47,1:19:33.64,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I recently got a mole under my eye,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.71,1:19:36.35,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,same spot as Nakano Minami,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.93,1:19:39.46,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and it turned kind of like a red mole,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.53,1:19:43.81,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and you don't usually get new moles at this age, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.21,1:19:48.26,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,So Eura got worried and looked it up for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.33,1:19:51.23,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Like—eighteen years old, that red-mole kind of thing—
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.31,1:19:56.54,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and she read me everything that came up,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.61,1:19:59.05,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and the cause was… curry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.49,1:20:03.46,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and the cause was… curry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.53,1:20:06.28,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,And it'd been right after we went out for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.35,1:20:09.78,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I don't know if she was worried, but she yelled,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.85,1:20:14.27,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,'It's curry, Ishii! This is common in your thirties!'
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.97,1:20:18.57,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Ayane's in her thirties?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.57,1:20:20.15,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.95,1:20:23.06,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So yeah—even that side of her…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:27.28,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But that cheeky cuteness is adorable to me too!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.35,1:20:30.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's rare someone researches why you got a mole…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.71,1:20:33.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,a kid who looks that up—
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.77,1:20:37.72,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's how much she loves Ishii,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.79,1:20:41.54,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I was really worried, so I looked it up,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.61,1:20:46.58,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and it was just curry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.65,1:20:49.99,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She's still only eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.19,1:20:54.04,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She's still only eighteen!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.11,1:20:57.74,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay, let's call on someone else!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.81,1:21:02.96,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,There are lots of things I love about Eura,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.03,1:21:05.85,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,and among them—she's great at batting!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.83,1:21:09.80,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,I truly respect that!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.87,1:21:13.44,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,The moment she hit it I froze from shock,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.51,1:21:17.25,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,since I'm so bad at it…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.75,1:21:23.41,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,and honestly she's such an attention-seeker!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.87,1:21:24.52,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.60,1:21:27.08,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,You know? Have you realized?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.60,1:21:29.74,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm not an attention-seeker!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.20,1:21:32.56,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,One year since unveiling and that's what you deny?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.82,1:21:38.20,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Fine—keep going once!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.10,1:21:44.05,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,If Ishii isn't there, Minami—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.12,1:21:45.58,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Wait wait—I'm third?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.92,1:21:48.54,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She just realized!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.28,1:21:51.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Hold on, Minami…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.39,1:21:53.49,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,No no, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.09,1:21:57.15,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,If Ishii isn't there, Minami—
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.23,1:22:00.84,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Don't decide I'm third on your own!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.91,1:22:05.06,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Don't decide I'm third on your own!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.13,1:22:06.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Maybe everyone's number one! Everyone's number one, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.95,1:22:07.67,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.19,1:22:09.59,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,So she always…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.67,1:22:12.49,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,she's always going 'Hey hey hey,'
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.87,1:22:14.59,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,and that part's cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.13,1:22:15.78,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.75,1:22:20.03,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,But she's actually pretty responsible,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.51,1:22:26.23,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,Looks-wise, how do I put it…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.75,1:22:29.60,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,she gets super clingy, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.67,1:22:33.70,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,when I stayed at Yuuka's place,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.77,1:22:37.40,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I dozed off, and when I woke up Yuuka had already bathed,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.47,1:22:42.28,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,'Ryu-chan, hurry and take a bath!'
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.35,1:22:46.82,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I just did an Eura impression,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.89,1:22:49.33,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,taking care of me like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.77,1:22:52.11,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,'Ryu-chan, over here already…'
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.53,1:22:54.47,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,'I'll stick to you, ken!' kind of energy,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.37,1:22:56.81,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Like that—that much?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.99,1:22:58.63,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She doesn't use that much dialect!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.49,1:23:02.95,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Rara's influence too—
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.35,1:23:05.55,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,'the live's gonna end, ken!' vibes,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.91,1:23:08.73,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,she's picking it up from Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.69,1:23:11.59,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Like it's spreading from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.51,1:23:16.45,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,After all, Ryuto's more of a baby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.87,1:23:19.35,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,It won't change! It won't change, right!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.41,1:23:25.76,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You're just as much of a baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.83,1:23:28.95,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I can take care of people and I don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.91,1:23:36.86,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yesterday's talk—
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.57,1:23:41.29,Generic,Aya-chan,0,0,0,,I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.59,1:23:44.85,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,She's fourteen, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.43,1:23:46.83,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Even though she took a step toward being an adult…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.39,1:23:52.64,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But somehow she's still so cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.14,1:23:54.10,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.58,1:23:55.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:57.46,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So then…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.99,1:24:01.97,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So then…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.63,1:24:04.27,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,we'd like to move to the next song!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.71,1:24:08.90,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,To all of you precious people,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.97,1:24:10.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,we want to convey in the next song!

; ===== mc3_birthday =====
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.06,1:41:25.08,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.22,1:41:26.87,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.66,1:41:38.79,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Bowling Ambition and 16-Color Dream Crayons—you've heard two songs in a row,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.86,1:41:40.10,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Is everyone getting hyped?!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.52,1:41:44.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.58,1:41:47.22,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Now we'd like to hear from today's star!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.11,1:41:53.33,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you for throwing such a wonderful birthday show for me today!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.66,1:42:00.29,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,From the moment I came out on Kizashi,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.36,1:42:04.77,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,everyone was holding light-blue and green penlights,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.84,1:42:07.14,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and I was so moved!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.34,1:42:17.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So this clingy cute little puppy…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.42,1:42:20.67,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,let's all keep loving her and being big sisters to her!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.74,1:42:23.14,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Now for the last song…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.52,1:42:26.17,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.84,1:42:30.70,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's the title track of this show—
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.30,1:42:32.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.64,1:42:36.90,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Everyone—today…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.16,1:42:40.18,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Do you know what day it is today?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.72,1:42:44.35,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.42,1:42:48.17,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,she turned 14—
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.24,1:42:53.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congrats, Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.32,1:43:00.82,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Yuuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.26,1:43:45.88,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.94,1:43:49.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone sing along—ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.10,1:43:52.77,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.84,1:43:56.86,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.85,1:44:20.89,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka—happy birthday for real!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.37,1:44:22.02,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.59,1:44:23.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.01,1:44:26.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So how does it feel being 14?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.29,1:44:31.30,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,The moment I turned 14,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.37,1:44:35.80,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I was wondering who'd message first,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.87,1:44:40.99,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and Ryuto and Kure-chan pinged me right away!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.31,1:44:45.11,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I replied half-asleep and went right back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.75,1:44:49.23,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.60,1:44:51.25,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's sleeping! / She was asleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.64,1:44:54.33,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,She's sleeping! / She was asleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.14,1:44:59.03,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay—today—sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.10,1:45:02.62,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,While we're here, let's take a commemorative photo!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.12,1:45:04.46,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.90,1:45:06.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Did you say commemorative photo?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.98,1:45:09.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Did you say commemorative photo?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.32,1:45:11.20,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Did you say commemorative photo?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.82,1:45:16.76,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.66,1:45:18.31,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.56,1:45:19.21,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.62,1:45:20.47,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sure—is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.54,1:45:25.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,We three did Ostrich together today!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.30,1:45:26.18,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.42,1:45:28.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.96,1:45:29.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.24,1:45:30.89,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.06,1:45:32.22,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yuuka's in the selection!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.62,1:45:33.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.72,1:45:35.58,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Three?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.06,1:45:38.44,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Wait, I meant two—isn't that few?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.64,1:45:39.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Wait, and also…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.98,1:45:40.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,One by one?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.86,1:45:45.65,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Two people who love me—come down!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.72,1:45:50.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.50,1:45:55.14,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I was way too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.26,1:45:57.92,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Shall we take the photo?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.24,1:45:59.63,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Isn't the front too crowded?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.70,1:46:00.35,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Isn't that too many?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.42,1:46:01.40,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,One, one, one…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.52,1:46:04.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka-chan in the middle! Come to the center!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.56,1:46:06.87,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka-chan in the middle! Come to the center!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.94,1:46:12.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Everyone make a '14'!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.36,1:46:14.92,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Won't this make us liars?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.68,1:46:16.44,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.53,1:46:21.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Nacchi, it's backwards!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.62,1:46:24.72,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Your clumsiness is showing!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.68,1:46:36.48,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Noisy Rara next to me wants some pose…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.96,1:46:40.66,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We did Ostrich today, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.63,1:46:54.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Minami who couldn't fit in front…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.95,1:46:58.14,Generic,Mii-na,0,0,0,,Sorry for being so considerate…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.20,1:47:00.81,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,No no—a floor pose is fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.82,1:47:23.34,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And today we have a letter entrusted to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.39,1:47:23.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.08,1:47:26.30,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ishii, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.90,1:47:28.48,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Sorry—ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.76,1:47:30.66,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Don't cry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.66,1:47:31.86,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.86,1:47:34.33,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I've already graduated from crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.40,1:47:35.26,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.70,1:47:44.02,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I'll read it aloud here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.86,1:47:45.51,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.92,1:47:48.38,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Dear Yuuka—happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.90,1:47:54.13,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Your year at 12: graduating elementary school, meeting HKT48,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.20,1:47:59.64,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,auditioning and making it into HKT48—what a year!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.50,1:48:02.44,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,How was your year at 13?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.80,1:48:04.12,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,It was fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.66,1:48:05.44,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.84,1:48:11.42,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I think Yuuka's year at 13 was one where she felt so many things.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.50,1:48:15.42,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Selected for senbatsu three months after joining—
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.22,1:48:22.72,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,your head and body couldn't keep up with everything to learn,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.81,1:48:31.07,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,When senbatsu was announced I couldn't immediately say congrats—I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.96,1:48:35.23,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Now, for the 18th single,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.30,1:48:40.96,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,thank you for working so hard also for the members who weren't selected.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.42,1:48:48.92,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,You worked hard without complaining—I truly respect you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.62,1:48:50.27,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.62,1:48:57.06,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,You're competitive about everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.66,1:49:00.41,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Even when we're gaming, if I'm winning…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.48,1:49:04.76,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and when I'm winning at a game you keep saying 'one more,'
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.24,1:49:08.00,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,but when you win you try to quit right away,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.23,1:49:12.19,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,so sometimes I get sulky—sorry for that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.61,1:49:13.57,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Sorry for that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.80,1:49:18.71,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But because we're both competitive and a bit childish…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.78,1:49:23.78,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But because we're both competitive and a bit childish, we push each other,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.90,1:49:28.12,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I have countless memories with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.60,1:49:30.62,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,lots of food reports for work,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.00,1:49:34.83,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,getting full,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.90,1:49:38.89,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,steak, ramen, pudding,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.96,1:49:42.15,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,You've always clung to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.22,1:49:44.90,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and behind the happiness I worried—
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.52,1:49:48.90,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,if I stayed beside you, could you talk with others and grow closer?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.38,1:49:51.72,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I was worried,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.82,1:49:58.74,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and when I might not be next to you anymore,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.49,1:50:03.03,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Could she talk with everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.89,1:50:06.87,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,So for a while I stepped back from you,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.39,1:50:10.31,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But I didn't need to worry—
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.77,1:50:14.53,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,you've grown closer with seniors and peers,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.03,1:50:18.33,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I felt relief and saw you grow,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.75,1:50:19.79,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and also a little lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.42,1:50:26.62,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,You used to ask me for eyeliner,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.20,1:50:29.32,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I'd shape and draw your brows,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.76,1:50:30.94,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,put on blush for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.08,1:50:35.15,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, without me even checking…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.22,1:50:37.40,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and before I knew it you could do makeup alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.16,1:50:40.52,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,growing like another child of mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.08,1:50:46.10,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and getting to watch a junior-high girl's little growth up close
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.86,1:50:47.96,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.27,1:50:53.07,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,But I'm a bit lonely, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.08,1:50:57.89,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Asking me for unit song advice,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.96,1:51:01.27,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,And when it doesn't go well…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.34,1:51:03.85,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and when it goes badly, scrunching your face and crying,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.92,1:51:06.84,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,running to me like a dog going 'Ishii—!'
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:08.88,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,coming to be comforted,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.10,1:51:13.84,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,crying harder than me at my birthday speech,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.44,1:51:18.44,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,being cheeky and teasing me constantly,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.90,1:51:24.33,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,hugging me right away when asleep,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.40,1:51:26.82,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and stubbornly hugging again when I peel you off,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.82,1:51:32.20,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,yet your waking attitude toward your mom is a bit sharp—
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.08,1:51:37.13,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,every moment feels like meeting a human I've never known,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.20,1:51:39.84,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and watching you makes me smile so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.48,1:51:45.54,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,You're always smiling and innocent,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.40,1:51:49.92,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,'Is it okay that I'm the one standing here?'
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.36,1:51:52.56,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and that you feel frustrated—I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.18,1:51:58.63,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Up front you hear unkind words,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.70,1:52:00.58,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and get compared sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.17,1:52:06.45,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,When it's hard or sad,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.07,1:52:09.03,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,or you don't know what to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.47,1:52:11.19,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can help, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.79,1:52:13.87,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,you've got me, reliable seniors,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.25,1:52:17.33,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and peers your age,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.81,1:52:21.35,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and when it hurts you can cry lots like always!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.88,1:52:26.52,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Someday I want to go with you and see the same views!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.53,1:52:31.16,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,As rivals, best friends, and little sisters—
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.23,1:52:33.27,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,let's keep growing from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.65,1:52:37.59,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Your crybaby side,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.59,1:52:39.51,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,your sharp tsukkomi too—
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.93,1:52:42.21,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,gen-mates and fans alike
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.63,1:52:44.25,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,love all of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.85,1:52:48.99,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,so keep scoring goals in everyone's hearts with that smile!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.28,1:52:52.36,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,And let's all grow together!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.24,1:52:58.86,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Your year at 14 too—let's make even more memories!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.60,1:53:00.52,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.98,1:53:02.58,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Happy birthday again!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.06,1:53:03.95,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,—From Ishii Ayane
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.02,1:53:10.52,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,We also have a letter from her mom,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.59,1:53:13.49,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,so we'll hand that over later.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.09,1:53:14.74,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.01,1:53:16.77,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay—and also, may I?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.85,1:53:18.50,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,So then…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.87,1:53:21.93,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,That was Ishii's letter—from her herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.35,1:53:23.31,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.31,1:53:24.91,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm fine—I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.91,1:53:30.01,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You are crying!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.92,1:53:32.72,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,You okay then?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.98,1:53:33.61,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.68,1:53:35.94,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm so, so happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.94,1:53:38.46,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I love you—thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.53,1:53:51.00,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Then—please open the birthday message…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.46,1:54:05.56,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'll read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.96,1:54:10.27,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to my birthday show,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.34,1:54:13.56,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and for watching on DMM—
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.31,1:54:24.81,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,At 13 so much happened—it was such a dense year.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.35,1:54:29.01,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'd like to look back on my year at 13 a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.31,1:54:34.42,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Just yesterday, as an HKT48 7th-gen member…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.49,1:54:35.97,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,that was allowed to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.71,1:54:40.24,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,That was the biggest thing since turning 13,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.31,1:54:43.13,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and my life changed completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.32,1:54:50.04,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,A year ago learning dance was hard,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.11,1:54:52.36,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,singing wasn't my strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.43,1:54:56.31,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and I just desperately tackled whatever was in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.33,1:55:03.18,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,But a year later I learn faster,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.25,1:55:06.29,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and I feel I have more room in my expression too.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.60,1:55:12.38,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Around August I was first selected for the 18th single,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.00,1:55:15.60,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I was really anxious,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.60,1:55:17.96,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,but I worked so hard in my own way!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.32,1:55:21.14,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Concerts, events…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.65,1:55:31.17,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,At 13 I sang and danced and experienced so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.37,1:55:34.80,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Watching seniors graduate,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.87,1:55:39.13,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I felt this environment won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.87,1:55:43.42,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I don't want to take standing on this stage for granted—
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.49,1:55:47.11,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I want to treasure this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.50,1:55:51.89,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,To the fans—through your mail and chat replies,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.96,1:55:55.82,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,you always give me warm words—thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.00,1:56:04.96,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Your feelings always reach me clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.73,1:56:08.90,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,So I can live up to the fans' expectations,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.97,1:56:11.70,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'll train harder in dance, singing, and talk,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.77,1:56:15.23,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and become a sparkling idol!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.31,1:56:20.37,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Someday I want you to think you're glad you supported me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.44,1:56:24.60,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Please keep supporting me!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.46,1:56:35.53,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,We can do idol work thanks to staff,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.60,1:56:38.31,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,costumes, and everyone behind the scenes—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.38,1:56:42.26,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,thank you always for supporting us!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.96,1:56:49.48,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,To my gen-mates—
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.69,1:56:55.69,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,7th gen is so kind and fun—being together is truly enjoyable!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.43,1:56:58.09,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you for always being beside me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.81,1:57:01.13,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Let's keep growing together!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.13,1:57:02.73,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Daa~isuki da yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.08,1:57:13.62,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,And to my family—thank you for signing me up for the audition back then without asking!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.55,1:57:17.86,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,At first I honestly didn't want it,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.93,1:57:21.14,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,but before I knew it I wanted it badly,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.21,1:57:25.45,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,and I see this view thanks to my family—thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.27,1:57:34.77,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Sorry for saying you couldn't come to the birthday show today!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.21,1:57:38.01,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Are you watching on DMM…?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.99,1:57:40.85,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.14,1:57:47.34,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for this wonderful birthday show today!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.94,1:57:51.13,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.20,1:57:54.60,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,so please keep supporting 14-year-old Eura Yuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.76,1:58:06.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Now once more—let's celebrate Yuuka's birthday together!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.44,1:58:07.72,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.28,1:58:14.78,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,And for the last song…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.57,1:58:16.29,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Ayane, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.86,1:58:22.24,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,The speeches,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.70,1:58:26.20,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,they're so full of what's good about Yuuka,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.64,1:58:28.10,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,even though she said she graduated from crying…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.54,1:58:31.68,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,she cried with such a cute smile at Ishii's letter,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.20,1:58:37.06,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,and everyone felt so fond,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.64,1:58:42.21,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,maternal feelings just spilled out!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.28,1:58:45.58,Generic,Aa-tan,0,0,0,,Let's keep loving Yuuka lots,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.26,1:58:48.21,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Now for the last song—
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.63,1:58:50.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,It's also the title of this show—
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.65,1:58:52.07,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Finally, please listen to this song—
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.07,1:58:53.23,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,How to Drink Ramune!
; ===== outro =====
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.65,2:08:04.53,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Thank you for Ramune no nomikata!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.45,2:08:09.38,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Yuuka-chan, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.98,2:08:13.13,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,Ishii's letter moved me so much, and…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.20,2:08:17.22,Generic,Yuuka,0,0,0,,getting to do Ostrich with these two was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.58,2:08:19.34,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Thank you—likewise!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.86,2:08:20.76,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It was fun!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.86,2:08:23.39,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Felt fresh for everyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.46,2:08:24.71,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.78,2:08:26.02,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Unit shuffle!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.20,2:08:31.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Lots of first-time unit kids too,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.50,2:08:34.07,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,and new costumes today!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.14,2:08:34.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.90,2:08:36.51,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,The hardest part was…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.58,2:08:38.08,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,I couldn't wear the new costume!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.50,2:08:39.53,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,That made me sad, but…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.60,2:08:40.25,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, right…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.32,2:08:40.99,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.06,2:08:42.89,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But who knows—tomorrow maybe…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.96,2:08:44.47,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,a different unit again!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.54,2:08:45.55,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It's a shuffle! / Shuffle, huh!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.62,2:08:47.07,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,It's a shuffle! / Shuffle, huh!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.14,2:08:47.79,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,My bad!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.50,2:08:49.45,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Won't make it…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.52,2:08:50.80,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Maybe I should calm down…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.18,2:08:53.23,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,But still…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.30,2:08:54.90,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,But next time too—you worked hard!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.64,2:08:56.69,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,In Rara's own way!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.76,2:08:57.62,Generic,Rara-pa,0,0,0,,Yes, I did my best!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.68,2:08:59.65,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Okay then—nice!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.72,2:09:00.37,Generic,Generic,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.62,2:09:02.15,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,Look forward to the next performance too!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.22,2:09:03.42,Generic,Host,0,0,0,,See you next time!
